<PageTitle>Residential lock out/Residential lost key - University of Virginia Facilities Management - Customer Portal</PageTitle>

<div class="container">
    <h2>Residential lock-out/Residential lost key</h2>
    <p>If you are locked out of your room, please call Facilities Management at <span class="bold">(434) 924-1777.</span> Someone will be dispatched to your location, typically within an hour.</p>
    <p>You <span class="bold">must</span> present a student ID or other form of photo ID (driver's license, state ID or military ID). If you do not have your ID, another student who has their ID may vouch for you.</p>
    <p>Please <a href="https://hms.housing.virginia.edu/lockchange/">report all lost or stolen access cards and keys online</a> to UVA Housing &amp; Residence Life.</p>
    <p>Additional information about security policies and associated costs are available on the <a href="https://housing.virginia.edu/locks">UVA Housing &amp; Residence Life Locks and Lockouts website</a>.</p>
</div>